  "content": "\n\nПривет мир\n\n<p>《失落纪元》旨在提供完整的模组化 Minecraft 体验，无需进行繁琐的研究或承受随之而来的信息过载。</p>\n<p>我们的重点是为对探索模组及其功能感兴趣的玩家提供量身定制的游戏内学习体验。玩家可按自己的节奏逐步了解，从而自由定义属于自己的玩法。</p>\n<p>它提供了一种普适性的体验，围绕科技、魔法及两者之间的内容构建了灵活且结构清晰的玩法，满足广泛的偏好需求。</p>\n<p>尽管内容丰富，但低系统配置要求确保了所有玩家都能畅玩，真正做到人人皆可参与。</p>\n<details>\n        <summary>\n                📋 模组列表：184\n        </summary>\n        <details>\n                <summary style=\"font-size:120%;\">\n                        <abbr title=\"核心玩法扩展\"><img><b>内容模组</abbr>: 66</b>\n                </summary>\n                <details>\n                        <summary>🔮 魔法 <small>(数量：18)</small></summary>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-magica-25\" target=\"_blank\"> Ars Magica 2.5</a> by\n                                TCLProject</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/2125369-tc4-5-addon-automagy-automation-and-logistics-v2\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Automagy</a> by Tuhljin</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1290532-1-10-2-1-9-4-blood-magic-v2-1-0-65-updated-sept\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Blood Magic</a> by WayofTime</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/botania\" target=\"_blank\"> Botania</a> by Vazkii</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/2818029-electroblobs-wizardry-the-expandable-rpg-magic-mod\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Electrobob's Wizardry</a> by Electroblob77</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1445828-tc4-addon-forbidden-magic-v0-575\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Forbidden Magic</a> by SpitefulFox</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forgotten-relics-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\"> Forgotten\n                                        Relics Unofficial</a> by Aizistral</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gadomancy\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Gadomancy</a> by Makeo\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/2328507\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Magia Naturalis</a> by Elenterius</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"[https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1287405-magic-bees-magic-themed-bees-for-forestry-the](https://modrinth.com/mod/magia-naturalis)\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Magic Bees</a> by MysteriousAges</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1292130-thaumcraft-6-1-beta26-no-longer-being-developed\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Thaumcraft 4</a> by Azanor</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thaumic-dyes\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Thaumic Dyes</a>\n                                by Amerem</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/1445786-1-6-4-1-7-10-thaumic-exploration-0-6-0-thaumcraft\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Thaumic Exploration</a> by Flaxbeard</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thaumic-horizons\" target=\"_blank\"> Thaumic Horizons</a> by\n                                Kentington\n                        </l