necarts</a> by ganymedes01</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Storage\n                                        Drawers</a> by jaquadro</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\"> Test\n                                        Dummies</a>\n                                by bonusboni</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidiplates\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        ObsidiPlates</a>\n                                by Myrathi</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/switches-continued\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Switches\n                                        Continued</a> by Myrathi</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Waystones</a> by\n                                BlayTheNinth</li>\n                </details>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n                <summary style=\"font-size:120%;\"><abbr\n                                title=\"性能优化模组、依赖库、API 与开发工具\"><b>技术模组</abbr>:\n                        61</b></summary>\n                <details>\n                        <summary>📚 依赖库 <small>(数量：19)</small></summary>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1289836-animationapi-animate-your-entities-v1-2-3\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Animation API</a> by thehippomaster21</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applecore-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\"> AppleCore</a> by\n                                squeek502