et/thread/11586-ic2-exp-1-7-10-1-8-9-1-10-2-uncomplication-ic2classic-e-net-ic2classic-recipes-o/?pageNo=1\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Uncomplications</a> by Aroma1997</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/witcherypatch\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Witchery\n                                        Patch</a> by TheSatanicSanta</li>\n                </details>\n                <details>\n                        <summary>🧰 实用工具 <small>(数量：6)</small></summary>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/advanced-backups\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Advanced\n                                         Backups</a> by MommyHeather</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/astraeusmercy\" target=\"_blank\"> Astraeus Mercy</a> by\n                                Bambam01</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-world-generator\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Default World Generator</a> by FireBall1725</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensional-flight-ban\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Dimensional Flight Ban</a> by ScarleTomato</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamAmeriFrance/Guide-API\" target=\"_blank\"> Guide API</a> by\n                                TeamAmeriFrance\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/oauth\" target=\"_blank\"> Oauth</a> by sintinium</li>\n                </details>\n                <details>\n                        <summary>🚧 开发工具 <small>(数量：14)</small></summary>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/2577119-better-questing-a-new-and-improved-questing-mod\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> Better Questing</a> by Funwayguy</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/craftpresence\" target=\"_blank\"> CraftPresence</a> by\n                                CDAGaming</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-main-menu\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Custom Main\n                                        Menu</a> by Lumien231</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/defaultserverlist\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        DefaultServerList</a> by glowredman</li>                \n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancedlootbags\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Enhanced\n                                        Lootbags</a> by yuesha_yc</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-blacklist\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Item\n                                        Blacklist</a> by DoubleDoorDev</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/its-the-little-things\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> It's\n                                        The Little Things</a> by Zlepper</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mcinstance-loader\" target=\"_blank\"> McInstanceLoader</a>\n                                by hrudyplayz\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modern-splash\" target=\"_blank\"> Modern Splash</a> by\n                                kappa-maintainer\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/2364943-modtweaker-0-7-x\"\n                                        target=\"_blank\"> ModTweaker 2</a> by joshiejack</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crafttweaker\" target=\"_blank\"> Minetweaker</a> by StanH\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lostera-coremod\" target=\"_blank\"> Pokepatch</a> by Powoke\n                        </li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regional-water\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Regional\n                                        Water</a> by Vexxel</li>\n                        <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tx-loader\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        Tx Loader</a> by glowredman</li>\n                </details>\n        </details>\n</details>\n<p><br />\n        &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n        <a title=\"Modrinth\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-lost-era/versions\"> <img\n                        src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/p87Jiw2q?color=1bd96a&amp;label=Modrinth Downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"\n                        alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"27\" />\n        </a>\n        &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n        <a title=\"Discord 邀请链接\" href=\"https://discord.gg/SZdz7JkuPJ\" target=\"_blank\"><img style=\"float: left;\"\n                        src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/765935575898259486?color=9c44ed&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=9c44ed&amp;style=flat-square\"\n                        alt=\"\" width=\"190\" height=\"27\" />\n        </a>\n        <a title=\"Reddit/r/Lost Era\" href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/Lost_Era/\" target=\"_blank\"><img\n                        src=\"https://img.shields.io/reddit/subreddit-subscribers/Lost_Era?label=Reddit%20-%20Lost%20Era&amp;logo=Reddit&amp;style=flat-square\"\n                        alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"27\" /></a><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5pipkNN.png\" alt=\"标题图 1\" width=\"824\" height=\"206\" /></p>\n<p>本整合包提供海量的<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #000000;\"><strong>3600+ 任务</strong></span>，旨在让模组内容与原版内容对所有玩家而言都易于上手。</p>\n\n<p>本整合包的任务系统允许玩家自由探索、按自己的方式推进进度，并以独特的风格游玩，同时在整个旅程中都有清晰的结构框架进行引导与支持。</p>\n\n<p>该体验专为多人游戏环境精心打造，即使偏好迥异的玩家也能在同一世界中和谐共处，无需妥协。</p>\n<p>我们还特别策划了额外的进阶路线，以探索非传统的玩法风格。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1dg5lqU.png\" alt=\"任务线\" width=\"823\" height=\"436\" /></p>\n<p>完成任意任务章节将使你深入理解各模组所能提供的全部内容，助你在任何投入的项目中充分发挥潜力。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sf1AhiP.png\" alt=\"详情\" width=\"1816\" height=\"899\" /></p>\n<p>随着游戏进程推进，这些章节将逐步解锁，确保你在接触更复杂的内容前已扎实掌握基础。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kl8wVC1.png\" alt=\"标题图 2\" width=\"824\" height=\"206\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">我们的整合包秉持“每种玩法皆具独特价值，各有专长”的理念。</span></p>\n<p>我们通过自定义合成配方、配置调整以及矿物生成修改来实现平衡，绝不采用不必要的繁琐机制。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">这从根本上杜绝了破坏平衡的机制，邀请你拥抱全新且均衡的体验，让你能够毫无顾虑地自由打造属于自己的独特冒险。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>每个类别都会带来独特而宝贵的内容，拥有各自的优劣势与截然不同的游玩风格。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mCJQr8j.png\" alt=\"另一张标题图\" width=\"824\" height=\"206\" /></p>\n<p>Minecraft 成功的关键之一在于其几乎能在任何系统上广泛运行。<br />为坚守这一理念，我们耗时数月精细调校整合包的性能，以实现最优的性能与内容比例，确保尽可能兼容各类电脑。</p>\n<p>因此，每种玩法均已得到充分完善，内容重叠极少甚至没有，大幅减少了传统“大杂烩”整合包中常见的功能臃肿问题，从而避免拖累性能。</p>\n<p><strong>最低配置要求：<br /></strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/RAM-3GB-0x29b93f\" alt=\"内存\"\n                width=\"68\" height=\"20\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CPU-2Ghz-0x29b93f\" alt=\"处理器\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" /></p>\n<p style=color: #FF0000;\"><mark><strong>需要 Java 8</span></mark></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">无论你是使用顶级电脑还是奶奶那台 IBM 个人电脑，所有人都能无限制地一起游玩。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/fJwxX3T.png\" alt=\"另一张横幅标题\" width=\"824\" height=\"206\" /></p>\n<p>在原版游戏中，生存模式极其安全，除前期外几乎没有真正的危险，导致许多模组内容显得过于冗余。</p>\n<p>为此，我们在原版生存体验的基础上进行了改进，重点让那些曾经平淡无奇的机制重新焕发活力，同时不增加整体游玩的复杂度。</p>\n<p>游戏中的食物、庇护所和自保手段不再形同虚设。探索洞穴将充满未知的阴森感，敌怪种类更加多样；地下城也更具威胁性，需要保持谨慎应对。</p>\n<p>游戏将继续保持适度的挑战性，让玩家能够充分利用并真正体会到模组化 Minecraft 中那些曾被忽视的中后期内容所带来的便捷体验。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">特别鸣谢：</span></strong><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><br />\n                        </span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>SeraphSanshiro</strong> - 感谢过去两年的支持，并提供了精美的视觉设计。</span></li>\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>BamBam01</strong> - 修复并创建了众多整合包急需的定制模组。</span></li>\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Swedish Kaito</strong> - 在发现漏洞与 Bug 方面做出了巨大贡献。</span></li>\n        <li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>PoWoKe</strong> - 为整合包进行了防呆处理与新手优化，并大幅提升了多项便捷功能。<br /></span></li>\n        <li><strong><b>TCLProject&nbsp;</b></strong>- 为任务系统的魔法分支做出了贡献，并定位了多处重大崩溃问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">……以及所有参与封闭测试、帮助我打磨体验的贡献者。</span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>想搭建自己的服务器？</strong></span> Bisect Hosting 提供简单且高质量的服务器解决方案。<br />点击下方图片即可开始，使用优惠码<strong> \"LostEra\"</strong> 首月可享 25% 折扣：</p>\n<p><a title=\"Promo Code Bisect\" href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/LostEra\"><img\n                        src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/92d83988-6346-4a60-86d7-b2afea324a7f.png\"\n                        alt=\"Bisect\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br /><br /><span\n                style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>遇到需要技术支持的问题？</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;请前往我们的 <span\n                        style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\"\n                                href=\"https://github.com/DrParadox7/Lost-Era-Modpack/issues\">GitHub Issues</a>&nbsp;</span>页面反馈。</span>\n</p>",
